{"product_id":"assorted-trifles","title":"Assorted Trifles","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"148\" data-end=\"206\"\u003eA delightful collection of wordplay, wit, and puzzles.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"558\"\u003e\u003cem data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"226\"\u003eAssorted Trifles\u003c\/em\u003e by Stanley Newman is a clever and entertaining mix of short writings, puzzles, trivia, and playful essays from one of America’s top crossword editors. With a sharp eye for language and a love for the quirky corners of knowledge, Newman presents a book that's perfect for puzzle lovers, word nerds, and fans of intellectual fun.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"560\" data-end=\"726\"\u003eWhether you're solving a riddle, pondering a paradox, or just enjoying some light reading with a twist, \u003cem data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"682\"\u003eAssorted Trifles\u003c\/em\u003e is full of surprises—each page a new treat.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"829\"\u003eAuthor: Stanley Newman\u003cbr data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"757\"\u003eISBN: 9780883659615\u003cbr data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"783\"\u003eFormat: Paperback\u003cbr data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"807\"\u003ePages: Approx. 200\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45621209989273,"sku":"1RD9780883659615","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/s-l1200_b0ecb420-c622-4b55-84f9-dbad9d5b16af.jpg?v=1754482754","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/assorted-trifles","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}